  "title": "Turkey Enchiladas",
  "description": "These turkey enchiladas are easy to make with leftover turkey, enchilada sauce, and lots of cheese for a tasty post-Thanksgiving meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Marta Sanchez"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-11-12T17:40:22-05:00",
